## 4. Execution Layer — Script Lifecycle

### Naming Convention = Execution Order

```
run_once_before_XXX-*.sh.tmpl     # Pre-install (drivers, kernels, repos) — runs ONCE
run_once_after_XXX-*.sh.tmpl      # Post-install (tools, configs) — runs ONCE
run_onchange_after_XXX-*.sh.tmpl  # Re-runs when template changes (configs, cron jobs)
```

**Numeric prefixes control order**:
- `100-199`: System prep (kernels, drivers, package repos)
- `200-299`: Desktop/WL config (WM, bluetooth, keyboard, Xorg)
- `300-399`: Language runtimes (Nix, asdf, mise)
- `400-499`: Editors/IDEs
- `500-599`: CLI tools & AI (mise, lazygit, glab, hermes, omniroute, coding-orchestrator)
- `600+`: Onchange (repo cloning, cron deployment, sync)

### Script Anatomy (Template)

```bash
#!/usr/bin/env bash

{{ template "common/script_is_not_ephemeral" . }}
{{ template "common/script_eval_mise" . }}
{{ template "common/script_helper" . }}

info ">>>>>> 🤖 Installing AI Tools 🤖 <<<<<<<"

{{- range .ai_tools.npm }}
{{- $enabled := .features.ai.coding_assistants }}
{{- if and $enabled (not .block_on_workplace) }}
info "Installing {{ .name }} (NPM)"
{{ .env | default "" }} npm install -g {{ .package }}
{{- if .completions_cmd }}
{{ template "common/script_validate_completions_path" $ }}
{{ .completions_cmd }} > "$HOME/.local/share/zsh/site-functions/_{{ .name }}"
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}

success ">>> 🤖 AI Tools Installed 🤖"
```

### Guards = Idempotency + Safety

| Guard | Checks | Exits 0 if |
|-------|--------|------------|
| `script_is_not_ephemeral` | `.settings.ephemeral` | Running in CI/Codespaces/DevContainer |
| `script_is_not_headless` | `.settings.headless` | No GUI, no TTY, SSH, container, WSL, Termux |

**Why this matters**: Same script runs on laptop (interactive, GUI) AND VPS (headless, SSH) AND CI (ephemeral) — guards prevent:
- Installing window managers on VPS
- Running interactive prompts in CI
- Starting GUI apps in SSH session

