## 5. Multi-Profile Architecture

### Profile Detection Logic (in `.chezmoi.yaml.tmpl`)

```go
// 1. Explicit override
$profile := env "CHEZMOI_PROFILE"

// 2. Workplace detection (hostname contains Zup identifier)
$ismanaged := ($hostLower | contains "zwpe0f96cn")
$profile = ($ismanaged | ternary "work" "personal")

// 3. VPS auto-detection (Oracle Cloud ARM64)
$isVps := or
  (env "CHEZMOI_VPS" | not | not)
  ($hostLower | contains "vps")
  ($hostLower | contains "vnic")
  (hasPrefix "instance-" $hostLower)
  (and (eq .chezmoi.os "linux") (eq .chezmoi.username "ubuntu") $sshSession (not $guiAvailable))

if $isVps { $profile = "vps" }
```

### Profile → Feature Matrix

| Feature | personal | work (Zup) | vps (Oracle) |
|---------|----------|------------|--------------|
| Window managers (i3, niri) | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ |
| Fonts, drivers, virtualization | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ |
| Ollama (local LLM) | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ |
| Tailscale VPN | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ (primary) |
| Dockge (Docker UI) | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ |
| Caddy reverse proxy | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ |
| Hermes Dashboard | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ (subdomain) |
| OmniRoute Dashboard | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ (subdomain) |
| Coding Orchestrator (nightly) | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ |
| Zup-specific configs (bob, VPN Instivo) | ❌ | ✅ | ❌ |
| `sudo` available | ✅ | ❌ (managed) | ✅ |

