## 7. AI Integration Architecture

### Three Pillars (All VPS-Only)

| Component | Role | Port | Domain | Auth |
|-----------|------|------|--------|------|
| **Hermes** | Personal assistant, skills, memory, cron | 9119 | `hermes.fabiosouzadev.duckdns.org` | Basic Auth |
| **OmniRoute** | AI gateway (local/remote models) | 20128 | `omniroute.fabiosouzadev.duckdns.org` | Password (env) |
| **Coding Orchestrator** | Autonomous coding agents (nightly) | — | — | — |

### Bootstrap Flow (VPS)

```
chezmoi apply
    │
    ├─▶ run_once_after_530-install-caddy.sh.tmpl     # Reverse proxy
    ├─▶ run_once_after_532-install-camofox.sh.tmpl   # Browser automation
    ├─▶ run_once_after_535-install-hermes-dashboard.sh.tmpl
    ├─▶ run_once_after_540-install-coding-orchestrator.sh.tmpl
    ├─▶ run_once_after_531-install-agentmemory.sh.tmpl
    └─▶ run_onchange_after_610-deploy-hermes-cron-jobs.sh.tmpl  # Cron jobs
```

### Coding Orchestrator (Nightly, 02:00 UTC)

- **Triggers**: GitHub label `coding-agent`, Telegram mention, webhook, cron
- **Agents**: Aider (default via OmniRoute), Claude Code, Codex, Gemini, OpenCode
- **Isolation**: Git worktrees (`~/worktrees/task-<id>`)
- **Budget**: $5/night total, $2/task max
- **Delivery**: Telegram, Notion, GitHub PR comments

