## 10. Verification Checklist

After analyzing a chezmoi repo, confirm:

- [ ] **Source dir identified** (`.chezmoiroot` exists and points to correct dir)
- [ ] **Environment detection understood** (ephemeral, headless, vps, profile logic clear)
- [ ] **Feature flags mapped** (hierarchy, defaults, overrides per profile)
- [ ] **Script inventory complete** (all `run_once_before/after`, `run_onchange_after` listed with order)
- [ ] **Guards present** on every script that shouldn't run in CI/headless/VPS
- [ ] **Ignore patterns correct** (OS-specific, VPS-specific, profile-specific exclusions)
- [ ] **Secret strategy clear** (age recipient, GPG legacy, private_* vs encrypted_*)
- [ ] **Data separation clean** (`.chezmoidata/` has platform data, no logic)
- [ ] **Template composition DRY** (common guards/helpers reused, not copied)
- [ ] **Documentation matches reality** (README, ARCHITECTURE.md, CONFIGURATION.md current)

